; The real-solver CLI (dev/bench tooling, NOT shipped) and its wiring unit tests. Both
; live under tests/ precisely because they link the TEST-ONLY SMT-LIB parser
; (oxsmt_smtlib_parser) — the shipped session library (oxsmt_interface) must never depend
; on the parser (DESIGN.md §3, AGENTS.md). oxsmt_cli is the harness SOLVER for `make test`
; (see the Makefile default). Test-only, but still stdlib-only over the smt/ libraries (I3).

(executable
 (name oxsmt_cli)
 (modules oxsmt_cli)
 (libraries
  oxsmt_core
  oxsmt_lia
  oxsmt_interface
  oxsmt_smtlib_parser
  oxsmt_smtlib
  oxsmt_query_loader))

; Live-consumer VC-corpus regression suite (make vc-corpus-test, bugreport 05): drives
; every corpus .smt2 (check-sat-assuming + get-unsat-core form) through the in-process
; Session.check_sat_assuming API via the SHARED loader, fails loudly on any verdict flip
; from the sidecar's expected verdict, and emits a core-vs-reference_core delta table.
; Reads its own minimal JSON sidecars (stdlib-only, I3). Included in `make test`.

(executable
 (name vc_corpus_test)
 (modules vc_corpus_test)
 (libraries
  oxsmt_core
  oxsmt_interface
  oxsmt_smtlib_parser
  oxsmt_query_loader))

