; Datatypes sat-model gate (make dt-sat-gate): drives the tests/dt-goldens-sat sat goldens
; through the real Session asserting a CHECKED sat, and proves Dt_model_check is RED against
; a deliberately-wrong constructor tree (banked review rule).

; dt-multi-query gate (make dt-multi-query-gate): the batched-VC-per-Session regression
; (task #51). Declares multiple datatypes across push-scoped checks in one Session via the
; accumulating declare_datatype API and asserts each stays checked-sat — RED before the DT
; theory read its registry by live ref, GREEN after. Documents the task #54 none-then-DT gap.

(executable
 (name dt_multi_query_gate)
 (modules dt_multi_query_gate)
 (libraries
  oxsmt_core
  oxsmt_interface
  oxsmt_smtlib_parser
  oxsmt_query_loader))

