; Arrays sat-model gate (make array-sat-gate): drives the tests/arr-goldens-sat sat goldens
; through the real Session asserting a CHECKED sat, pins the commit -> Array_model_check
; wiring via a fault-injection stub, and proves the checker rejects an unsatisfiable
; storeinv-shape array query (RED against a checker bypass).

(executable
 (name array_sat_gate)
 (modules array_sat_gate)
 (libraries
  oxsmt_core
  oxsmt_interface
